<title>USA: Periphonics sets 2-for-1 stock split.  [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>Periphonics sets 2-for-1 stock split.  [CORRECTED]</headline>
<dateline>BOHEMIA, N.Y. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periphonics Corp said it has set a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>New shares will be issued on October 31, 1996 to shareholders of record at the close of business October 15, 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of shares outstanding to 13.6 million (corrects from 12.6 million) from 6.8 million, Periphonics said.</p>
</text>
